{"about":["Key Features: • Travel to the Lonely Mountains!","Ride along quiet mountain lakes, majestic forests and steep canyons • A custom physics system lets you carefully drop from boulder to boulder, sprint over abysses or slide through muddy grounds • Find your own way - take a relaxing scenic…","• No audience, no barrier tapes - experience a beautiful nature unspoiled by men • Find the perfect bike for your playstyle and unlock dozens of paint jobs and outfits!"],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307psGPhib6XU6TIxSJahaM3krbuleGfWEfIEOeoG-I_IYl3ocnKttOs0FAcI3oRPPSWAe6fWaFPeHmdk36Lf_9q81TUQL.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307psGPhib6XU6TIxSJahaM3krbuleGfWEfIEOeoG-I_IYl3ocnKttOs0FAcI3oRPPSWAe6fWaFPeHmdk36Lf_9q81TUQL.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307L4wMYKWgu3pJVu9mBTQsRAYPzDwJGmwssh56GFWjHn4b4DcK8yRx_79AKf4mQkxg4SnI7k3Fz9wWHqT6aWS4jgjc1IW.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307L4wMYKWgu3pJVu9mBTQsRAYPzDwJGmwssh56GFWjHn4b4DcK8yRx_79AKf4mQkxg4SnI7k3Fz9wWHqT6aWS4jgjc1IW.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307pImX13mRobGLymjPrDlw8LNtvsmQyDl7IVtzhWif4gA5FouJJ4gYk8asffgyG58OSKOOLsMVr51n_daMlRK1E06Awps.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307pImX13mRobGLymjPrDlw8LNtvsmQyDl7IVtzhWif4gA5FouJJ4gYk8asffgyG58OSKOOLsMVr51n_daMlRK1E06Awps.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"}],"summary":""}